{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"html","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HTML"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/html"},{"type":"text","value":" entry exports the HTML renderer without React."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  renderBlock,\n  renderDocument,\n  renderHtml,\n  renderInline,\n} from '@tanstack/markdown/html'","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"renderhtml","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderHtml"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderHtml(\n  input: MarkdownInput,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parses string input when necessary and renders all document children joined by newlines."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"renderdocument","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderDocument"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderDocument(\n  document: MarkdownDocument,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Renders an existing document. This is an alias with a narrower input type."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"renderblock","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderBlock"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderBlock(\n  node: BlockNode,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runs extension HTML hooks, then renders one block node."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"renderinline","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderInline"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderInline(\n  node: InlineNode,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runs extension HTML hooks, then renders one inline node."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"render-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" includes every "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParseOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" field plus:"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Behavior"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"highlighter"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"none"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return trusted HTML for code contents"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"codeLineNumbers"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"unset"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Forward the preference and add "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tm-code--line-numbers"},{"type":"text","value":" when true"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"headingAnchors"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Append default or configured links to headings with IDs"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When rendering a pre-parsed document, parse-only options do not retroactively change its AST. Renderer options and extension "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderHtml"},{"type":"text","value":" hooks still apply."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"html","text":"HTML","level":1},{"id":"renderhtml","text":"renderHtml","level":2},{"id":"renderdocument","text":"renderDocument","level":2},{"id":"renderblock","text":"renderBlock","level":2},{"id":"renderinline","text":"renderInline","level":2},{"id":"render-options","text":"Render options","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# HTML\n\nThe `@tanstack/markdown/html` entry exports the HTML renderer without React.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  renderBlock,\n  renderDocument,\n  renderHtml,\n  renderInline,\n} from '@tanstack/markdown/html'\n```\n\n## `renderHtml`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderHtml(\n  input: MarkdownInput,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nParses string input when necessary and renders all document children joined by newlines.\n\n## `renderDocument`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderDocument(\n  document: MarkdownDocument,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nRenders an existing document. This is an alias with a narrower input type.\n\n## `renderBlock`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderBlock(\n  node: BlockNode,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nRuns extension HTML hooks, then renders one block node.\n\n## `renderInline`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderInline(\n  node: InlineNode,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nRuns extension HTML hooks, then renders one inline node.\n\n## Render options\n\n`RenderOptions` includes every `ParseOptions` field plus:\n\n| Option | Default | Behavior |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `highlighter` | none | Return trusted HTML for code contents |\n| `codeLineNumbers` | unset | Forward the preference and add `tm-code--line-numbers` when true |\n| `headingAnchors` | `false` | Append default or configured links to headings with IDs |\n\nWhen rendering a pre-parsed document, parse-only options do not retroactively change its AST. Renderer options and extension `renderHtml` hooks still apply.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: HTML\n---\n\n# HTML\n\nThe `@tanstack/markdown/html` entry exports the HTML renderer without React.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  renderBlock,\n  renderDocument,\n  renderHtml,\n  renderInline,\n} from '@tanstack/markdown/html'\n```\n\n## `renderHtml`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderHtml(\n  input: MarkdownInput,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nParses string input when necessary and renders all document children joined by newlines.\n\n## `renderDocument`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderDocument(\n  document: MarkdownDocument,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nRenders an existing document. This is an alias with a narrower input type.\n\n## `renderBlock`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderBlock(\n  node: BlockNode,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nRuns extension HTML hooks, then renders one block node.\n\n## `renderInline`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderInline(\n  node: InlineNode,\n  options?: RenderOptions,\n): string\n```\n\nRuns extension HTML hooks, then renders one inline node.\n\n## Render options\n\n`RenderOptions` includes every `ParseOptions` field plus:\n\n| Option | Default | Behavior |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `highlighter` | none | Return trusted HTML for code contents |\n| `codeLineNumbers` | unset | Forward the preference and add `tm-code--line-numbers` when true |\n| `headingAnchors` | `false` | Append default or configured links to headings with IDs |\n\nWhen rendering a pre-parsed document, parse-only options do not retroactively change its AST. Renderer options and extension `renderHtml` hooks still apply.\n"}
